    "common_rejection_reasons": [
      "- PR #24474: Closing as superseded: `@codemirror/legacy-modes` 6.5.5 changed its dependency from `@codemirror/language` to the new `@codemirror/streamparser` package, so its parsers are now typed as `streamparser.StreamParser`. This repo's lockfile pins `@codemirror/language` 6.12.3, whose `StreamLanguage.define` only accepts its own `StreamParser` type — hence the TS2345 failures in `DrasiConfigModals.tsx` / `DrasiStreamSamples.tsx` on this PR. The bump is only type-safe together with `@codemirror/language` >= 6.13.0, which re-exports the streamparser types.",
